        <mxCell id="killer-import-edit" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=16;fontColor=#263238;strokeColor=#8C9AA1;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" value="另存为草稿 → 选择空位，或明确确认替换&#xa;缺少蛊虫可收藏草稿；具备条件后才能启用" vertex="1">
